  "id": "prelingually-deafened",
  "term": "prelingually deafened",
  "definition": "Prelingually deafened describes children or adolescents who became deaf before developing spoken language. In this context, it refers to people whose later speech and language outcomes may vary even when they have cochlear implants and similar hearing experience.",
